   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Brightvane Energy is compliant with all three covenants on the Venture Term Loan for the period ended October 31, 2026. The certificate figures agree with the bank's calculations in each case. The main change is a steady monthly shortening of runway, with calculated runway now at {{fact:03b5274b-ce22-44dc-a909-68cd4fb0797c}} months against a floor of {{fact:a3016cc7-c315-47bb-bba2-6eae70f903b9}}. Cushion on the runway and unrestricted cash tests is narrowing as a result. No breach or open work item requires a decision this period, but the burn trend warrants monitoring.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway is compliant at {{fact:03b5274b-ce22-44dc-a909-68cd4fb0797c}} months against a required {{fact:a3016cc7-c315-47bb-bba2-6eae70f903b9}}, a cushion of {{fact:988eb01a-2ade-4939-b5a5-ae4ec33ab4dc}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash is compliant at {{fact:f294dc87-0da8-4b48-a408-60e6282f193e}} against a required {{fact:c2893b24-aaa2-48eb-b939-7efd5860a9b2}}, a cushion of {{fact:d743013d-09b0-4c4a-ac7d-0103574bf33d}}. Revenue to Plan is compliant at {{fact:28c266fd-7d7d-4780-a690-c1a57149a6c8}} against a required {{fact:28db7d03-1ea8-4845-89de-1b1803efaa5e}}, a cushion of {{fact:54aafa37-f291-492d-923e-1ee1f19e073e}}, which is the narrowest of the three. Reported certificate values match the bank's calculations for all three covenants.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"The most significant signal, rated medium, is falling runway: runway has shortened every month from the end of July to the end of October, indicating sustained cash burn without new funding. Two low-severity signals show the same erosion in covenant cushion, on unrestricted cash, now {{fact:d743013d-09b0-4c4a-ac7d-0103574bf33d}}, and on runway, now {{fact:988eb01a-2ade-4939-b5a5-ae4ec33ab4dc}}, both lower than in August. A reviewer should note that the cash signal describes that test as the thinnest, whereas Revenue to Plan carries the smaller cushion at {{fact:54aafa37-f291-492d-923e-1ee1f19e073e}}. No work items are open.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
